      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air, this is the virtual assistant. How can I help?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "hi i need to book my yearly furnace tune up",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure, I can set that up. Is the address you want serviced the one on file, or somewhere else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "um yeah it's my home let me see it's one eight eight 10 64th avenue fresh meadows zip is one one three six five",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "We cover that area. I don't see an account at that address under this number. Is this the first time you've booked with us?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yeah first time i've been meaning to set it up for a while",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Good, we'll get you set up. What kind of furnace do you have, and roughly how old is it?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "i'm honestly not sure of the model it's a gas furnace i think it's maybe ten years old the house was built in the eighties and we replaced it once i think",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "That's fine, the technician will check the model when they arrive. Who's at home for the visit, and is there anything they should know, like a gate code or a dog?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "just me i'm home most mornings no dog there's a side gate but it's not locked so they can come right through",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, the side gate is open. Is there a time of day that works best for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "mornings are best any weekday morning is fine with me",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have openings tomorrow, Tuesday, Friday, or next Monday, all in the morning, 8 to 12. Which day works for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "tomorrow works the tuesday morning whatever time slot is open",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Tomorrow morning, 8 to 12, is open. Shall I book that?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yes please book it",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'll read back the details first. What's the best number to reach you at?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "the best number is my cell six three one five five five zero one four seven",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Let me read that back: your home at 188-10 64th Avenue, Fresh Meadows, 11365, and the best number is 631, 555, 0147. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "wait the zip is wrong it's one one three six six not one one three six five",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for catching that. Let me read it back: your home at 188-10 64th Avenue, Fresh Meadows, 11366, and the best number is 631, 555, 0147. Is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yes that's right thank you",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "The system needs a couple of details for the technician. Is it a furnace for heating only, or does it also run air conditioning? And how long have you had it?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "heating only we don't have central air and i think we've had it about ten years maybe a little more",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, heating only, about ten years. Have you noticed any problems with it lately, or is this just the yearly check?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "just the yearly check it's been running fine though it's been making a little banging noise when it kicks on so if they can look at that great",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I'll pass that along for the technician. Who's the approver for this work, is it you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "yes it's me rina patel",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "You're all set for tomorrow, Tuesday, with the technician arriving between 8 and 12. They'll check the banging noise too. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "no that's everything thanks bye",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air. Stay warm out there.",
          "said": null
        }
